<title>UK: UK meals/feeds easier on quiet market.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds easier on quiet market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>As expected business was almost at a standstill on the UK meals and feeds market on Friday following the U.S. holiday on Thursday.</p>
<p>Lower prices failed to attract buyers with high protein soymeal unchanged in the near months and as much as three stg down in the forward postions.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
